. WAVEDEMO - Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-1.47B resource demo (ESP-IDF v6.1)
.gitignore files git ignores (build output, secrets.mk, sdkconfig, zips)
CMakeLists.txt ESP-IDF top-level project file
Makefile build / flash shortcuts (supplied by the user)
partitions.csv flash partition table (two OTA slots, NVS, coredump)
sdkconfig.defaults build settings: PSRAM, BLE, USB disk, Wi-Fi, RAM placement
dependencies.lock exact versions of the managed components (keep in git)
README.txt user documentation: commands, NV keys, SD card, screens, IMU, scripts
SCRIPTING.txt script language specification
SCRIPTING_REF.txt script language quick reference
NOTES.txt working notes: rules, build setup, hardware facts, decisions, progress
TODO.txt todo list
DESCRIPT.ION file descriptions for this folder
src firmware sources (ESP-IDF component)
assets files built into the firmware
tools helper scripts for developers
tests board test procedures and PC tests
sd SD card layout: copy the contents to the card
